      "headline": {
        "en": "Corpay report: non-bank NAV lending margins widen to 794bp as bank margins narrow",
        "zh": "Corpay报告：非银NAV贷款利差扩大至794个基点，银行利差收窄"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Corpay Private Markets' fifth Lender Book Report found average non-bank NAV lending margins widened from 756 basis points in February 2025 to 794 basis points in August 2026, while average bank NAV margins narrowed from 447 to 435 basis points. Alternative credit providers account for around 30 per cent of lenders tracked on Corpay's Alpha Match platform, up from roughly 25 per cent three years ago. Corpay said its data is weighted toward mid-market and complex NAV facilities and does not necessarily indicate rising non-bank NAV pricing across the whole market.",
        "zh": "Corpay Private Markets第五份《Lender Book Report》显示，非银NAV贷款平均利差从2025年2月的756个基点扩大至2026年8月的794个基点，而银行NAV平均利差同期从447个基点收窄至435个基点。在Corpay Alpha Match平台追踪的贷款机构中，另类信贷机构占比约30%，三年前约为25%。Corpay表示其数据偏向中型及复杂的NAV融资，未必意味着整个市场的非银NAV定价上升。"
      },
